WEBVTT

00:22.800 --> 00:23.730
Adjutant Zhang,

00:24.320 --> 00:25.350
about what happened earlier,

00:25.350 --> 00:27.150
I hope you don't take it to heart.

00:38.030 --> 00:39.650
You are too noisy.

03:02.410 --> 03:09.130
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

03:09.420 --> 03:12.020
[Episode 26]

03:40.840 --> 03:43.800
[Jiutou Yandai, Caravan Tactician]

03:45.210 --> 03:47.400
This woman is so heavy-handed.

03:48.630 --> 03:50.500
She doesn't look like someone
who's dying at all.

03:50.500 --> 03:53.210
Su Ya, you old jerk!

03:54.280 --> 03:55.550
Let me go!

03:55.910 --> 03:58.540
Yell again, and I'll cut out
your brothers' tongues!

03:58.540 --> 03:59.780
Let's fight one-on-one!

03:59.780 --> 04:01.710
I'll give you a two-move handicap!

04:01.780 --> 04:03.340
As long as they haven't entered Bailejing,

04:03.340 --> 04:04.940
I have a way to approach them.

04:05.250 --> 04:06.300
They are a caravan

04:06.300 --> 04:08.870
that has been traveling
in this area year-round.

04:08.870 --> 04:11.200
Their tactician is called Jiutou Yandai.

04:11.410 --> 04:13.120
As his name indicates,

04:13.120 --> 04:14.140
he has 9 pipes.

04:14.620 --> 04:17.310
His tobacco is made of
various strange secret medicines.

04:17.310 --> 04:18.950
Smoking it makes you
completely disoriented.

04:18.950 --> 04:19.720
Some

04:20.000 --> 04:22.190
even have all sorts of unexpected effects.

04:22.190 --> 04:22.870
It's him.

04:25.630 --> 04:26.860
Jiu or Shan something,

04:26.860 --> 04:28.520
let me ask you a few questions.

04:31.690 --> 04:32.950
Let me go!

04:33.600 --> 04:34.810
Let's fight one-on-one!

04:34.810 --> 04:36.740
I'll give you a two-move handicap!

05:03.630 --> 05:05.690
-Chief Shan! Chief Shan!
-Chief Shan! Chief Shan!

05:05.690 --> 05:08.450
-Murder! Murder!
-Murder! Murder!

05:09.330 --> 05:10.390
-Murder!
-Murder!

05:12.180 --> 05:15.110
-Murder! Murder! Murder!
-Murder! Murder! Murder!

05:25.920 --> 05:27.520
Stop! Stop!

05:29.730 --> 05:30.560
Stop!

05:30.870 --> 05:31.570
Stop!

05:34.950 --> 05:36.150
Are you going to talk?

05:37.860 --> 05:39.190
Who are you?

05:39.220 --> 05:40.460
What do you want?

05:41.130 --> 05:43.770
I am the top detective in Nanqiang.

05:44.130 --> 05:46.530
Patrolling here with my colleagues today,

05:46.630 --> 05:48.490
I feel an overwhelming evil aura.

05:48.680 --> 05:50.120
I must set up a clever layout,

05:50.120 --> 05:50.890
risk my own life,

05:50.890 --> 05:54.220
and go deep into the tiger's den
to investigate thoroughly.

05:54.940 --> 05:56.030
Top detective?

05:57.630 --> 05:59.360
Do you even believe yourself?

06:00.190 --> 06:01.330
What do you know?

06:01.920 --> 06:04.010
Everything is under my control now.

06:04.420 --> 06:06.290
Who do you think you are?

06:07.690 --> 06:08.930
Okay, okay, okay.

06:10.060 --> 06:10.470
Okay.

06:11.420 --> 06:11.920
Go on.

06:13.160 --> 06:14.560
Do you know Zhang Qiling?

06:15.750 --> 06:16.420
No.

06:17.570 --> 06:18.830
Answer properly.

06:18.830 --> 06:20.980
I really don't know him,

06:20.980 --> 06:22.010
Top Detective.

06:22.310 --> 06:24.290
Then why are you cursing Priest Su Ya?

06:24.290 --> 06:26.170
Everyone here seems to love him.

06:26.190 --> 06:29.050
Su Ya seems very humble on the surface,

06:29.740 --> 06:32.510
but secretly,
he does all kinds of dirty deeds.

06:32.870 --> 06:34.530
Extorting money, murdering.

06:34.790 --> 06:35.560
Do you know why my brothers and I

06:35.560 --> 06:36.680
were arrested?

06:37.420 --> 06:38.130
Why?

06:39.000 --> 06:41.020
He wanted me to help him
kill people along the way

06:41.020 --> 06:42.350
and transport corpses.

06:42.630 --> 06:44.159
Transporting corpses again.

06:44.159 --> 06:45.190
Old jerk.

06:45.390 --> 06:47.320
Who does he think Jiutou Yandai is?

06:47.360 --> 06:48.440
I'm a real man.

06:49.150 --> 06:51.280
I would rather die than do such a thing.

06:51.450 --> 06:53.730
Su Ya, you jerk!

06:54.270 --> 06:55.570
Untie me right now!

06:55.980 --> 06:57.380
Let's fight one-on-one.

06:57.890 --> 06:58.690
I'll kill you.

06:59.250 --> 07:00.450
Do you want to get out?

07:01.810 --> 07:02.750
Of course, I do.

07:04.450 --> 07:06.110
Then help me take off my shoes.

07:25.400 --> 07:27.990
[Su Ya, High Priest of Bailejing]

07:31.600 --> 07:32.330
High Priest,

07:33.130 --> 07:35.659
this is a token
of our family's appreciation.

07:36.060 --> 07:37.330
You saved my grandson.

07:38.100 --> 07:40.360
You are a benefactor to our whole family.

07:48.850 --> 07:50.020
Is that all?

07:58.230 --> 07:59.480
This is my dowry.

07:59.860 --> 08:01.460
It is top-grade Hetian jade.

08:01.510 --> 08:03.240
Please accept it, High Priest.

08:03.990 --> 08:05.490
Do you not like these?

08:06.190 --> 08:08.850
How about we bring you
something else tomorrow?

08:20.320 --> 08:22.450
Your eye is not bad.

08:30.990 --> 08:31.920
Please sit, Miss.

08:31.920 --> 08:33.380
The High Priest is busy
with something at the moment.

08:33.380 --> 08:34.710
He will be here shortly.

08:35.039 --> 08:36.900
Let's go. Let's head out. Come on.

08:39.010 --> 08:39.539
Let's go.

09:50.410 --> 09:51.740
Gu-Bite Casket?

09:52.150 --> 09:54.550
Something not even the Archives could find

09:54.730 --> 09:55.730
is actually here.

10:07.340 --> 10:08.630
About what happened just now,

10:08.630 --> 10:09.890
thank you.

10:11.330 --> 10:12.660
What's your name?

10:13.620 --> 10:14.750
My surname is Zhang.

10:24.820 --> 10:27.160
You have already met.

10:27.270 --> 10:28.850
That is my family.

10:29.240 --> 10:32.040
It doesn't like me
entertaining beautiful women.

10:32.560 --> 10:34.330
It will be watching from above.

10:35.740 --> 10:38.050
You should mind your boundaries.

10:38.080 --> 10:39.810
Don't make it unhappy.

10:48.390 --> 10:51.530
Miss Zhang, you don't look like a local.

10:52.660 --> 10:55.660
What brings you to Bailejing?

10:57.270 --> 10:58.270
Looking for someone.

10:58.270 --> 10:59.220
Who?

10:59.220 --> 11:00.390
Feikun Balu.

11:10.640 --> 11:12.520
All our people

11:12.550 --> 11:14.530
want to see Feikun Balu.

11:15.240 --> 11:17.610
If you want to see a god,

11:17.970 --> 11:20.180
you must worship devoutly.

11:21.020 --> 11:23.480
Have you ever made
offerings to the true god?

11:23.840 --> 11:25.820
As a priest of Bailejing,

11:25.850 --> 11:27.560
have you seen Feikun Balu
with your own eyes?

11:27.560 --> 11:30.490
I am the messenger
of the true god Feikun Balu.

11:30.520 --> 11:31.550
What do you think?

11:32.320 --> 11:33.180
Where did you see him?

11:33.180 --> 11:35.750
No one dares to speak to me like that.

11:35.770 --> 11:37.540
Do you know who I am?

11:54.520 --> 11:55.360
Guards!

11:59.900 --> 12:01.990
Send her straight to Jin for a snack.

12:02.060 --> 12:02.320
Yes.

12:02.320 --> 12:02.750
Yes.

12:24.690 --> 12:26.550
Where are you kicking?

12:26.570 --> 12:27.520
Are you blind?

12:27.680 --> 12:29.690
Down, down.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.540
Here?

12:30.560 --> 12:31.280
No, no.

12:31.690 --> 12:32.260
Here, yes.

12:32.260 --> 12:32.660
Okay.

12:32.960 --> 12:33.820
-Here?
-Right.

12:34.550 --> 12:35.260
To the right.

12:35.260 --> 12:36.080
Yes, yes.

12:36.150 --> 12:36.990
Right here, right here.

12:36.990 --> 12:37.650
Right here.

12:41.430 --> 12:42.590
Forward, forward.

12:46.500 --> 12:47.160
Fire.

12:47.340 --> 12:47.860
Fire.

12:47.880 --> 12:48.670
Fire, fire.

12:52.960 --> 12:53.800
I got it.

12:53.970 --> 12:55.230
Hold on. Turn forward.

12:58.930 --> 12:59.840
Come on.

13:25.620 --> 13:26.270
-Murder!
-Murder!

13:26.270 --> 13:27.330
-Murder!
-Murder!

13:27.510 --> 13:28.320
-Murder!
-Murder!

13:28.320 --> 13:29.110
I killed someone!

13:29.110 --> 13:30.120
Catch me!

13:30.320 --> 13:31.680
Come catch me!

13:31.790 --> 13:33.940
-Murder! Murder!
-Murder! Murder!

13:34.080 --> 13:36.080
-Murder! Murder!
-Murder! Murder!

13:49.320 --> 13:49.960
Jerk,

13:49.980 --> 13:51.700
untie us. Hurry!

13:56.020 --> 13:57.470
This tobacco is something.

13:57.470 --> 13:58.870
It's called Obedience Tobacco.

13:58.870 --> 14:00.560
As long as you start with "Jerk,"

14:00.560 --> 14:02.220
they'll do whatever you want.

14:05.160 --> 14:06.030
Jerk,

14:06.660 --> 14:07.710
tell me

14:08.100 --> 14:10.160
how to get to High Priest Su Ya's room.

14:18.770 --> 14:19.620
Behave!

14:19.680 --> 14:21.880
Or I'll feed you all to the snakes later!

14:25.290 --> 14:25.840
Dad.

14:26.280 --> 14:27.130
Are we

14:27.150 --> 14:29.270
really going to die here?

14:29.860 --> 14:31.600
So the rumors are true.

14:33.180 --> 14:34.030
Rumors?

14:35.210 --> 14:36.340
What rumors?

14:37.200 --> 14:38.240
A few years ago,

14:38.580 --> 14:40.820
I heard the priest went into the mountains
to worship the gods

14:40.820 --> 14:42.740
and died of illness on the way.

14:43.040 --> 14:44.440
He was about to be buried,

14:44.960 --> 14:46.820
but he actually came back to life.

14:47.030 --> 14:48.990
I heard he met Feikun Balu,

14:49.270 --> 14:50.720
was saved by him,

14:51.290 --> 14:53.270
and became his messenger.

14:54.000 --> 14:55.930
Everyone thought it was a miracle.

14:56.400 --> 14:59.030
In the first few years
after coming back to life,

14:59.030 --> 15:00.700
the priest was just like before

15:00.700 --> 15:02.250
a kind-hearted person.

15:02.640 --> 15:03.570
But a year ago,

15:03.600 --> 15:04.290
people started saying

15:04.290 --> 15:06.130
his temperament changed drastically,

15:06.130 --> 15:08.240
becoming very greedy and cruel.

15:08.270 --> 15:09.650
But no one had seen it,

15:10.650 --> 15:11.850
so no one believed it.

15:12.510 --> 15:13.250
Turns out...

15:13.800 --> 15:15.540
turns out it's actually true.

15:17.950 --> 15:18.380
Dad.

16:01.440 --> 16:02.480
Go back.

16:07.090 --> 16:09.220
I need to go back.

17:12.970 --> 17:13.700
Who's there?

17:15.770 --> 17:16.400
Let's go!

17:18.339 --> 17:19.520
Guards!

17:52.800 --> 17:54.860
This tobacco of yours is really nice.

17:55.260 --> 17:56.660
Give it to me for some fun.

17:56.880 --> 17:57.660
No.

17:58.170 --> 17:59.360
Then I can at least take this, right?

17:59.360 --> 18:00.090
Give it to me.

18:01.160 --> 18:01.920
You...

18:12.790 --> 18:13.850
Don't come closer!

18:15.410 --> 18:17.270
If you come closer, I'll throw it.

18:43.230 --> 18:44.630
This old man's treasures

18:44.770 --> 18:46.770
are even more than Jiutou Yandai's.

19:12.650 --> 19:13.750
This damn bow.

19:35.710 --> 19:37.260
My King Bow.

19:39.460 --> 19:40.430
Kill them.

19:41.470 --> 19:43.730
Kill them all!

19:56.090 --> 19:56.710
Mentor.

19:58.940 --> 19:59.470
Let's go.

20:01.970 --> 20:02.640
Dude!

20:06.740 --> 20:08.140
They all call me Big Pot.

20:08.570 --> 20:10.460
I still don't know what to call you.

20:10.460 --> 20:11.590
My surname is Zhang.

20:12.080 --> 20:13.060
Zhang.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.810
I hope we can meet again.

20:17.080 --> 20:18.880
I hope we can meet again, Big Pot.

20:21.730 --> 20:22.190
Go.

20:33.650 --> 20:35.490
Where did these two come from?

20:35.610 --> 20:37.200
To be so stupid
as to offend the High Priest.

20:37.200 --> 20:37.640
Shh.

20:37.760 --> 20:39.940
The High Priest has been erratic lately.

20:39.940 --> 20:41.420
Many people in the mansion have died.

20:41.420 --> 20:43.270
We should catch these two as scapegoats.

20:43.270 --> 20:45.200
Otherwise, we will be next.

20:45.280 --> 20:46.400
Then let's catch them quickly

20:46.400 --> 20:47.240
and kill them.

20:47.660 --> 20:48.190
Let's go.

20:49.630 --> 20:53.770
[Wanted]

21:07.560 --> 21:09.400
[Wanted]

21:11.010 --> 21:12.850
Did I owe them in my past life?

21:15.420 --> 21:15.760
[Wanted]

21:17.250 --> 21:17.740
Sir,

21:18.430 --> 21:19.810
do you have firearms and gunpowder?

21:19.810 --> 21:20.810
I'll buy them all.

21:20.870 --> 21:21.790
No firearms.

21:21.980 --> 21:22.810
Gunpowder was just...

21:22.810 --> 21:23.740
All bought out.

21:23.760 --> 21:24.890
Out again?

21:24.920 --> 21:26.380
They were just bought out.

21:26.840 --> 21:27.500
Leave.

21:27.690 --> 21:28.620
You're too late.

21:31.420 --> 21:33.090
Who's the blind fool

21:33.090 --> 21:34.220
working against me?

21:35.640 --> 21:36.510
He just left.

21:41.670 --> 21:43.360
I'm the clerk from the hardware store.

21:43.360 --> 21:44.740
The boss asked me to help deliver.

21:44.740 --> 21:45.570
Where are you going?

21:45.570 --> 21:47.090
How come I didn't see you in the store?

21:47.090 --> 21:47.950
I just started.

21:48.030 --> 21:49.510
Does delivery cost extra?

21:49.510 --> 21:50.230
No.

21:50.250 --> 21:52.020
Then I'll trouble you.

21:52.310 --> 21:53.720
Deliver it behind that mountain.

21:53.720 --> 21:54.240
Okay.

21:54.420 --> 21:55.010
Oh right.

21:55.400 --> 21:56.160
The boss said

21:56.180 --> 21:58.040
he forgot to give you your change.

21:58.180 --> 21:58.780
Really?

21:59.410 --> 22:00.810
Then wait for me a moment.

22:09.900 --> 22:10.620
Wait.

22:12.240 --> 22:13.630
Give them back to me!

22:13.790 --> 22:14.670
You liar!

22:14.700 --> 22:16.010
Give them back!

22:16.050 --> 22:16.910
Give them back!

22:21.270 --> 22:21.930
Move aside!

22:25.950 --> 22:27.390
Give them back!

22:28.610 --> 22:29.290
Sister!

22:29.310 --> 22:30.400
Give them back!

22:30.420 --> 22:31.420
Liar!

22:31.440 --> 22:32.670
Give them back!

22:36.590 --> 22:38.190
Here's another accomplice!

22:38.660 --> 22:39.520
Wait for me!

22:44.030 --> 22:44.690
Move aside!

22:49.550 --> 22:50.050
Stop!

22:50.680 --> 22:51.680
Get out of the way!

22:53.510 --> 22:54.310
Stop running!

22:55.750 --> 22:56.310
Stop!

22:58.030 --> 22:58.590
Don't mess around!

22:58.590 --> 22:59.310
Stop!

23:12.980 --> 23:13.780
Stop running!

23:13.920 --> 23:14.440
Stop!

23:38.310 --> 23:39.910
Why are they only chasing me?

23:47.830 --> 23:48.980
A flare shot.

23:53.130 --> 23:56.480
[Priest Su Ya's Mansion]

26:03.640 --> 26:04.420
Shrimpie,

26:05.010 --> 26:06.210
what happened to you?

26:10.540 --> 26:12.200
Someone, go check over there!

27:11.780 --> 27:13.180
Shrimpie, where are you?

27:33.760 --> 27:36.090
They just ran this way. Search.

27:36.380 --> 27:37.640
See where they all are.

28:04.810 --> 28:06.140
Open all these coffins.

28:10.540 --> 28:11.070
Nothing.

28:11.830 --> 28:12.360
Nothing.

28:32.030 --> 28:32.830
Shh.

29:38.330 --> 29:39.390
We are safe for now.

29:39.850 --> 29:40.330
You...

29:40.400 --> 29:41.780
Are you crazy? What's wrong with you?

29:41.780 --> 29:42.500
I... you...

29:42.530 --> 29:43.490
I think there's something wrong with you.

29:43.490 --> 29:44.190
Robber!

29:44.220 --> 29:44.630
Hooligan!

29:44.630 --> 29:45.430
Stop arguing.

29:45.700 --> 29:47.160
You two gave me a headache.

29:49.830 --> 29:51.070
Why did you take someone's thigh bone?

29:51.070 --> 29:52.110
Send it back.

29:53.810 --> 29:55.540
I know how to find Zhang Qiling.

29:57.420 --> 29:58.570
Who is Zhang Qiling?

29:59.270 --> 30:00.530
None of your business.

30:00.980 --> 30:02.680
She is my sister.

30:02.710 --> 30:03.950
Who do you think you are?

30:03.950 --> 30:05.010
She is my mentor's wife.

30:05.010 --> 30:07.070
Stop claiming false relationships.

30:17.220 --> 30:18.680
The marks on this bone

30:18.680 --> 30:21.200
were left by the Zhang family's
unique bone-scraping tool.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.480
If I'm not mistaken,

30:22.500 --> 30:24.570
the chief must have handled these bones.

30:24.570 --> 30:26.090
So as long as we figure out

30:26.090 --> 30:27.590
where these bones came from,

30:27.590 --> 30:28.550
we can find him.

30:29.090 --> 30:29.940
Little Taoist,

30:29.940 --> 30:31.830
do you know any place in Bailejing

30:31.830 --> 30:33.890
that specializes in handling bones?

30:35.380 --> 30:36.580
I actually do.

30:37.830 --> 30:40.930
Xigudong, one of the Six Great Fortresses
of Nanqiang.

30:41.510 --> 30:43.150
The people in Bailejing believe

30:43.150 --> 30:45.610
that a person's skin, flesh, and bones

30:45.630 --> 30:47.220
are 3 different things.

30:47.310 --> 30:48.660
Flesh has the shortest lifespan,

30:48.660 --> 30:50.980
so people can only live
as long as their flesh lives.

30:50.980 --> 30:52.460
But bones are different.

30:53.060 --> 30:54.920
Bones have the longest lifespan.

30:55.050 --> 30:57.590
Forty-nine days after death,
the skin dies.

30:57.610 --> 30:59.330
And 30 years after death,

30:59.450 --> 31:00.730
the bones finally die.

31:00.750 --> 31:01.530
So they believe

31:01.530 --> 31:03.350
that physical death is not true death.

31:03.350 --> 31:05.850
As for the bones
stripped of skin and flesh,

31:05.870 --> 31:08.110
they are sent to Xigudong to be washed

31:08.160 --> 31:09.440
and then returned to their relatives.

31:09.440 --> 31:10.330
Xigudong?

31:11.580 --> 31:12.770
Where is the entrance?

31:12.770 --> 31:13.830
Do you know the way?

31:17.140 --> 31:17.870
I don't know.

31:18.290 --> 31:20.080
I thought you knew everything.

31:20.110 --> 31:20.890
But I know,

31:21.400 --> 31:22.780
among the Six Great Fortresses
of Nanqiang,

31:22.780 --> 31:24.030
only the outermost Bailejing

31:24.030 --> 31:24.900
allows outsiders to enter.

31:24.900 --> 31:25.940
The rest do not.

31:26.480 --> 31:27.080
Moreover,

31:27.640 --> 31:28.790
among these fortresses,

31:28.790 --> 31:30.320
there is an unwritten rule.

31:30.680 --> 31:31.660
That is, in each fortress,

31:31.660 --> 31:32.770
only a very few people

31:32.770 --> 31:34.670
know how to enter the next fortress.

31:34.670 --> 31:36.600
The mountain roads and valleys
are complicated,

31:36.600 --> 31:37.660
just like a maze.

31:38.310 --> 31:39.830
I don't think we can get in.

31:41.810 --> 31:43.660
Are you going to Xigudong to find someone?

31:43.660 --> 31:44.570
I heard that Bailejing

31:44.570 --> 31:46.140
holds a Bone-Washing Ceremony every year,

31:46.140 --> 31:47.450
and it's happening in these two days.

31:47.450 --> 31:49.300
You can participate
as long as you prepare a set of bones.

31:49.300 --> 31:49.950
But...

31:50.290 --> 31:51.050
for the Bone-Washing Ceremony,

31:51.050 --> 31:53.350
the bones need to be at least
10 years old.

32:00.000 --> 32:02.260
How many years has your mentor been dead?

32:05.490 --> 32:10.070
[Mentor Zhang Qianzhang's Tomb]

32:10.300 --> 32:12.740
Mentor, I'm sorry.

32:17.550 --> 32:19.090
Mentor,

32:19.090 --> 32:20.950
I am so sorry.

32:21.660 --> 32:23.740
I am sorry.

32:26.200 --> 32:28.310
I didn't want this either.

32:28.940 --> 32:30.290
That's enough.

32:47.570 --> 32:48.350
Don't you...

32:49.570 --> 32:51.160
have anything to say to him?

33:11.670 --> 33:13.150
Then stay one more night.

33:13.720 --> 33:15.640
We must go to Xigudong tomorrow.

33:18.900 --> 33:19.780
Also,

33:19.860 --> 33:21.190
call Zhang Hailou back.

34:08.170 --> 34:09.159
A flare shot.
